---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';

const services = [
  { name: 'Websites', detail: 'Fast, static, built to be found by search engines and by AI models.' },
  { name: 'Social campaigns', detail: 'Content that runs where your audience already is, on a cadence you can sustain.' },
  { name: 'Marketing strategy', detail: 'What to say, to whom, and in what order. The plan before the spend.' },
  { name: 'Lead generation', detail: 'Qualified prospects into your pipeline, priced on outcomes, not impressions.' },
  { name: 'Content systems', detail: 'Editorial engines that keep producing after the engagement ends.' },
  { name: 'AI visibility', detail: 'Structured data, schema, and llms.txt so language models can find and cite you.' },
];
---
<Layout title="Paul Ann Media - Get Your Name Out There">
  <section class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden bg-navy text-cream lg:block">
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 pt-6 pb-14 sm:pt-10 sm:pb-16 lg:py-32">
      <div class="flex max-w-xl flex-col lg:block lg:max-w-lg xl:max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-teal">For owners who do the work</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl text-balance">
        Get your name out there.
      </h1>
      <p class="order-last mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-light lg:order-none">
        You run the business ... We build the websites, campaigns and content so your customers can find you.
      </p>
      <a href="#contact"
         class="mt-9 self-start inline-block rounded bg-teal px-8 py-3 font-semibold text-navy hover:bg-teal-light transition-colors">
        Start a Conversation
      </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative order-first h-56 sm:h-80 lg:order-none lg:absolute lg:inset-0 lg:h-full">
      <img
        src="/media/hero-pam-r2-1900.webp"
        srcset="/media/hero-pam-r2-1000.webp 1000w, /media/hero-pam-r2-1900.webp 1900w"
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 100vw, 170vw"
        alt="A worker checks a bin in a warehouse aisle in early-morning light"
        width="1900"
        height="830"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-20 lg:hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(26,47,61,0) 0%, rgba(26,47,61,1) 100%)"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 hidden lg:block" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(26,47,61,0.95) 0%, rgba(26,47,61,0.88) 38%, rgba(26,47,61,0.55) 58%, rgba(26,47,61,0) 78%)"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What we do</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-slate">
      Six services that compound. Most clients start with one and grow into several.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {services.map(s => (
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-6">
          <p class="font-semibold text-navy">{s.name}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate">{s.detail}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-navy/10 bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Why work with us</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate">
        Most agencies learn your business on a discovery call. We start where you are: what you sell, who buys it, and how they find you today. Then we build what gets you found ... and keep it working.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate">
        We also know what not to sell you. Not every problem is a marketing problem,
        and we'll say so.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Our own products</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-slate">
      We don't only build for clients. We build and run our own ... which is how we stay honest
      about what works.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="https://hometimejobs.com" class="rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-7 hover:border-teal transition-colors">
        <p class="font-semibold text-navy">HomeTimeJobs</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate">
          A CDL driver platform organized around home time, not cents per mile.
          Driver audience, carrier pipeline.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-ink">hometimejobs.com &rarr;</p>
      </a>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-7">
        <p class="font-semibold text-navy">Paul Ann Labs</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate">
          Our sister company. Where marketing ends and operations begin ... AI deployed
          inside the business itself.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate">In development</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="bg-navy-deep py-20 text-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Start a conversation.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-light">
        Tell us what you're trying to grow. If we're not the right fit, we'll say that too ...
        and usually point you somewhere better.
      </p>
      <ContactForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
